    "id": "du_m_qbn",
    "name": "Heart of Zealand",
    "icon": "grand_banquets",
    "repeatable": false,
    "player_playstyle": "administrative",
    "chance": 5000,
    "notes": "Ringsted lies in the middle of Zealand, far from any coast, among the best grain fields of the realm. The Valdemar kings lie in Saint Bendt's church and Zealand's Landsting meets here. We are neither old nor new, neither proud nor humble: we are the centre.",
